<title>THAILAND: Laem Thong Bank Q1 net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Laem Thong Bank Q1 net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		     (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997		     1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     0.26	vs	   0.29</p>
<p>    Net		     41.56	vs	  39.95</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. Laem Thong Bank Plc said its first quarter earnings per share was diluted by its capital hike in mid-1996 to 160.24 million from 139.90 million. Laem Thong Bank Plc is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
